{"title":"Speak Easy Toronto - Social/Karaoke Event","startsAt":"2026-10-02T19:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-02T23:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Looking to meet new people, practice your English, and enjoy a fun night out?\nSpeak Easy Toronto is a relaxed social event for locals, newcomers, international students, and young professionals come together for conversation, friendship, and cultural exchange.\nThere are no lessons, tests, or formal classes—just friendly conversations in a welcoming pub atmosphere. Whether you're fluent in English, still learning, or simply interested in meeting people from different backgrounds, everyone is welcome.\nEnjoy: 🍻 Casual vibes *location/pub/bar changes weekly!*\n🗣️ English conversation and language exchange\n🌎 Meeting people from around the world\n🤝 Making new friends and expanding your social circle\n👕 A curated vintage clothing pop-up shop coming soon\n🎉 Fun, low-pressure socializing\nCome on your own or bring friends. Many attendees arrive solo, making it easy to join conversations and connect with new people.\n\nKaraoke 🎤 will be available!\n\n$5 sign up *cash or e-tansfer accepted*\n\n*Please also make sure to order at least one drink or food from venue\n\nYou’re welcome to join the event after it has started. However, if you can no longer attend, please make sure to cancel your RSVP.","venue":{"name":"Ace of Spades Lounge and Events","address":"536 Manning Ave Lower Level, Toronto","lat":43.660393,"lng":-79.41476,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":5,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Speak Easy Toronto - Social Event","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/f/9/b/highres_535104475.jpeg"}